  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Task: The **n-queens** puzzle is the problem of placing `n` queens on an `n x n` chessboard such that no two queens attack each other.\n\nYou receive an integer `n`, output *all distinct solutions to the **n-queens puzzle***. You may output the answer in **any order**.\n\nEach solution includes a distinct board configuration of the n-queens' placement, where `'Q'` and `'.'` both indicate a queen and an empty space, respectively.",
    "constraints": [
      "1 <= n <= 9"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
